      "text": [
        "3916 - وَ سُئِلَ عَلِيٌّ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنْ قَوْلِ اَللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ: ۝ وَ عَلَى اَللّٰهِ فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ اَلْمُتَوَكِّلُونَ ۝\nقَالَ \"اَلزَّارِعُونَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3916 - Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) was asked about the saying of Allah (swt), the Mighty and Glorious: \"And upon Allah (swt) let the reliant rely\" (Surah Ibrahim 14:12).\nImam (as) said: \"It refers to the farmers.\""
        ]
